WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.147 --> 01:55.848
=Episode 17=

22
01:58.040 --> 01:59.120
The police took Zhang Yu in

23
01:59.439 --> 02:00.480
for questioning.

24
02:00.640 --> 02:01.599
Looks like Lin Qiang

25
02:01.840 --> 02:03.280
still didn't dare cross Di Liren.

26
02:05.560 --> 02:06.239
But it's good.

27
02:06.519 --> 02:08.319
Now we've completely stopped Di Liren

28
02:08.400 --> 02:09.280
from producing more

29
02:09.319 --> 02:10.218
bad Jinghua samples.

30
02:10.520 --> 02:11.400
It was worth it.

31
02:12.240 --> 02:13.319
Too bad for Zhang Yu.

32
02:14.719 --> 02:16.080
She became Di Liren's scapegoat.

33
02:16.840 --> 02:17.439
From the start,

34
02:17.520 --> 02:18.599
he had an exit strategy.

35
02:18.599 --> 02:19.919
That's why he's so cunning.

36
02:20.400 --> 02:22.080
He plans ten steps ahead

37
02:22.199 --> 02:23.800
and always leaves a backup plan.

38
02:24.479 --> 02:25.159
Also,

39
02:25.759 --> 02:27.159
he uses anyone around him

40
02:27.280 --> 02:28.240
he can exploit.

41
02:28.759 --> 02:29.599
Zhang Yu

42
02:29.719 --> 02:31.080
was actually a good employee,

43
02:31.319 --> 02:32.439
competent and hardworking.

44
02:32.840 --> 02:33.987
She trusted the wrong guy.

45
02:34.788 --> 02:35.479
Is there any way

46
02:35.479 --> 02:36.439
we can help her?

47
02:37.039 --> 02:38.400
Her conviction can't be changed.

48
02:39.400 --> 02:40.360
Although Di Liren

49
02:40.360 --> 02:41.919
used her trust and admiration

50
02:42.479 --> 02:43.400
to drag her down,

51
02:43.719 --> 02:44.280
it's an fact

52
02:44.599 --> 02:45.680
that she took luxury cars

53
02:45.680 --> 02:47.240
and expensive gifts.

54
02:47.599 --> 02:48.719
She isn't so innocent.

55
02:49.520 --> 02:51.479
Blind trust always traps you.

56
02:53.159 --> 02:53.479
I wish

57
02:53.479 --> 02:54.479
she'd been more cautious.

58
02:55.599 --> 02:57.360
I wish you could cheer up.

59
02:58.840 --> 03:00.560
Look on the bright side.

60
03:00.960 --> 03:01.479
Think.

61
03:01.800 --> 03:03.240
Mr. Dong has cleared his name

62
03:03.280 --> 03:04.280
and can help you.

63
03:04.919 --> 03:06.520
And the Jinghua project

64
03:06.520 --> 03:07.479
needs a leader now.

65
03:07.840 --> 03:08.759
Isn't this your chance

66
03:08.759 --> 03:09.599
to come back?

67
03:10.240 --> 03:10.879
You're right.

68
03:12.039 --> 03:13.520
It's time for Di Liren

69
03:13.639 --> 03:14.479
to properly explain

70
03:14.479 --> 03:15.360
my "condition".

71
03:18.876 --> 03:22.184
(Jiali)

72
03:24.280 --> 03:25.000
Good morning.

73
03:30.000 --> 03:30.840
Why are you here?

74
03:31.479 --> 03:32.759
The misunderstanding's blown up.

75
03:33.120 --> 03:33.639
Mr. Di,

76
03:33.919 --> 03:34.960
you have to help me

77
03:35.199 --> 03:36.520
clear it up with everyone.

78
03:38.000 --> 03:38.924
What misunderstanding?

79
03:39.599 --> 03:40.439
Tell them

80
03:40.840 --> 03:41.800
my "mental illness"

81
03:41.919 --> 03:43.159
was something you and I

82
03:43.319 --> 03:44.199
made up together.

83
03:45.319 --> 03:46.439
Didn't we agree back then?

84
03:46.879 --> 03:48.400
I'd pretend to be unstable

85
03:48.520 --> 03:50.159
and step back from the Jinghua project

86
03:50.560 --> 03:52.048
so the mole would lower their guard

87
03:52.240 --> 03:53.520
and slip up.

88
03:54.879 --> 03:55.879
Did you forget, honey?

89
03:57.120 --> 03:57.759
It's fine.

90
03:58.199 --> 03:59.960
My assistant Harry

91
04:00.039 --> 04:01.039
was there too.

92
04:01.280 --> 04:02.280
I can call him right now

93
04:02.439 --> 04:03.479
to back me up.

94
04:04.520 --> 04:04.960
Wait.

95
04:08.919 --> 04:09.879
Do you remember now?

96
04:11.479 --> 04:13.159
I guess we did agree on that.

97
04:14.560 --> 04:15.199
Good.

98
04:16.796 --> 04:18.800
(Jiali)

99
04:18.800 --> 04:19.319
This

100
04:19.399 --> 04:20.680
is the psychiatric evaluation

101
04:20.879 --> 04:21.920
from the hospital.

102
04:22.360 --> 04:24.199
(Medical Record) It clearly states

103
04:24.560 --> 04:25.879
that I'm fine both mentally

104
04:26.120 --> 04:27.079
and psychologically.

105
04:31.199 --> 04:32.959
All right, now we all know.

106
04:34.279 --> 04:35.199
Today's theme

107
04:35.319 --> 04:36.319
is the Jinghua series.

108
04:36.879 --> 04:37.480
Honey,

109
04:38.120 --> 04:39.360
you can wait in my office.

110
04:40.680 --> 04:42.040
While everyone's here today,

111
04:42.959 --> 04:44.560
I have an announcement to make.

112
04:46.680 --> 04:48.600
I'm applying to return to Jiali

113
04:49.319 --> 04:50.240
to fight alongside

114
04:50.319 --> 04:51.040
you all again.

115
04:51.959 --> 04:52.959
We'll discuss your

116
04:53.040 --> 04:54.040
personal matters later.

117
04:54.639 --> 04:55.279
Let's not waste

118
04:55.439 --> 04:56.399
everyone's time, okay?

119
04:56.519 --> 04:58.519
Since Meng is in good health

120
04:59.120 --> 05:00.000
and has done well,

121
05:00.680 --> 05:02.000
let her return to the company.

122
05:03.519 --> 05:04.800
The reason I'm so eager

123
05:04.839 --> 05:05.920
to return to Jiali

124
05:07.000 --> 05:08.240
is that I care deeply

125
05:08.319 --> 05:09.199
about Jinghua.

126
05:10.480 --> 05:11.120
I believe

127
05:11.120 --> 05:12.240
we need someone now

128
05:12.360 --> 05:13.560
who can get Jinghua

129
05:13.759 --> 05:14.839
back on track

130
05:14.959 --> 05:15.920
for an immediate launch.

131
05:16.560 --> 05:17.319
So,

132
05:17.920 --> 05:18.839
I want to volunteer

133
05:19.519 --> 05:20.720
to lead this project myself.

134
05:21.040 --> 05:21.680
I object.

135
05:22.959 --> 05:24.240
You were away from the company

136
05:24.759 --> 05:25.680
and out of the loop

137
05:25.680 --> 05:26.360
for some time.

138
05:26.839 --> 05:28.360
Jinghua needs to hit the market fast.

139
05:29.040 --> 05:30.199
We need a leader

140
05:30.360 --> 05:31.920
who has overseen the project

141
05:31.959 --> 05:32.639
from the start.

142
05:33.360 --> 05:33.839
Right.

143
05:34.759 --> 05:35.920
Tight time, high stakes.

144
05:36.519 --> 05:37.360
If Mr. Di

145
05:37.360 --> 05:38.560
leads the team himself,

146
05:38.920 --> 05:39.839
that would be ideal.

147
05:40.079 --> 05:41.160
I wouldn't recommend that.

148
05:41.920 --> 05:42.519
First,

149
05:42.600 --> 05:43.839
given the Zhang Yu issue,

150
05:44.439 --> 05:45.160
Mr. Di

151
05:45.600 --> 05:46.519
should recuse himself.

152
05:47.120 --> 05:47.600
Second,

153
05:48.079 --> 05:48.639
Mr. Di carries

154
05:48.639 --> 05:49.959
a heavy burden every day,

155
05:50.040 --> 05:51.240
with so many responsibilities.

156
05:51.519 --> 05:52.959
He simply doesn't have the time

157
05:53.079 --> 05:54.120
to juggle this too.

158
05:56.439 --> 05:57.240
Don't you agree,

159
05:58.439 --> 05:59.040
Ms. Gao?

160
05:59.839 --> 06:01.639
If Mr. Di has his hands full,

161
06:01.869 --> 06:02.639
giving it to Ms. Yu

162
06:02.639 --> 06:03.800
is definitely the safest way.

163
06:04.360 --> 06:05.759
They can coordinate anytime.

164
06:09.759 --> 06:11.319
During the recent audit,

165
06:12.120 --> 06:12.879
I was immersed

166
06:12.959 --> 06:13.800
in this project,

167
06:14.480 --> 06:16.120
so I know every single detail

168
06:16.199 --> 06:17.279
inside out.

169
06:18.360 --> 06:19.920
Besides, my dad always taught me

170
06:20.480 --> 06:21.865
never to leave things half-done.

171
06:24.240 --> 06:25.439
Since I uncovered

172
06:25.560 --> 06:26.439
Jinghua's issues,

173
06:26.879 --> 06:28.120
I want to see them through.

174
06:28.759 --> 06:29.600
I hope you all

175
06:29.879 --> 06:30.720
can give me

176
06:30.720 --> 06:31.560
this opportunity.

177
06:41.639 --> 06:42.199
Mr. Tian,

178
06:42.800 --> 06:43.600
how about this?

179
06:44.040 --> 06:44.800
Let's

180
06:45.199 --> 06:45.920
take a vote.

181
06:46.439 --> 06:46.879
All right.

182
06:51.240 --> 06:53.448
♪Even the future is enchanted by me♪

183
06:53.448 --> 06:56.456
♪Everywhere I go is an iconic scene♪

184
06:57.399 --> 06:58.240
Then Jinghua

185
06:58.639 --> 06:59.959
is in Meng's hands.

186
07:00.920 --> 07:02.160
Don't worry, Mr. Tian.

187
07:04.840 --> 07:05.928
♪Lucky♪

188
07:06.600 --> 07:07.176
(Brand Ambassador Yu Meng)

189
07:07.176 --> 07:08.264
(General Manager Yu Meng)

190
07:09.800 --> 07:10.680
I'll terminate Jiali's

191
07:10.680 --> 07:12.040
partnership with Guangsili'er

192
07:12.720 --> 07:13.959
and sue them for breach.

193
07:15.199 --> 07:15.920
Have legal

194
07:15.959 --> 07:16.920
prepare the paperwork

195
07:16.920 --> 07:17.759
and the complaint.

196
07:18.079 --> 07:18.560
Understood.

197
07:23.040 --> 07:24.759
It wasn't an easy battle.

198
07:25.759 --> 07:27.199
Thankfully, we're both back.

199
07:29.079 --> 07:30.319
Mr. Dong,

200
07:31.399 --> 07:32.639
having you back

201
07:33.160 --> 07:34.439
is what makes me happiest.

202
07:37.308 --> 07:38.472
(CFO Dong Jun)

203
07:40.480 --> 07:41.040
Come in.

204
07:42.319 --> 07:42.959
Congratulations.

205
07:46.560 --> 07:47.639
My former boss is here too.

206
07:49.839 --> 07:51.000
Welcome back, Ms. Yu.

207
07:52.639 --> 07:53.920
If you have a moment,

208
07:53.920 --> 07:55.959
could you approve the budget application

209
07:55.959 --> 07:57.639
I submitted last time?

210
07:58.680 --> 08:00.560
Mr. Wu, you seem unaware

211
08:00.560 --> 08:01.639
that signing and approval

212
08:01.639 --> 08:03.120
requires proper protocol.

213
08:03.839 --> 08:05.399
It's first come, first served.

214
08:05.800 --> 08:07.639
I need to clear earlier files

215
08:07.879 --> 08:09.120
before getting to yours.

216
08:10.040 --> 08:11.680
(Ms. Yu, you might not know)

217
08:12.199 --> 08:12.959
that Finance

218
08:12.959 --> 08:14.079
has procedures.

219
08:14.279 --> 08:15.079
One at a time.

220
08:15.560 --> 08:16.879
First come, first served.

221
08:17.120 --> 08:18.319
You need to approve

222
08:18.319 --> 08:20.000
Jinghua's production increase first

223
08:20.480 --> 08:21.639
(before we process)

224
08:21.680 --> 08:22.399
(the lab budget.)

225
08:23.920 --> 08:24.360
Ms. Yu,

226
08:24.639 --> 08:26.000
please don't hold it against me.

227
08:26.000 --> 08:27.360
It's a bad habit of mine.

228
08:27.959 --> 08:28.879
When it comes to work,

229
08:28.879 --> 08:30.519
I can be too rigid sometimes.

230
08:31.839 --> 08:32.519
Wu Heng,

231
08:33.080 --> 08:34.000
did you forget

232
08:34.039 --> 08:35.759
why you were fired in the first place?

233
08:40.399 --> 08:41.159
Well...

234
08:41.879 --> 08:42.600
Let's skip

235
08:42.919 --> 08:44.600
the document for today.

236
08:45.360 --> 08:46.080
I quit.

237
08:46.720 --> 08:47.919
I'll resign, alright?

238
08:49.519 --> 08:50.320
Sure,

239
08:52.600 --> 08:53.480
but resigning

240
08:53.480 --> 08:54.799
requires protocol too.

241
08:55.279 --> 08:56.840
"Rules are rules,"

242
08:57.120 --> 08:58.320
as you said yourself.

243
08:58.879 --> 08:59.480
Go on.

244
09:00.200 --> 09:01.200
Follow the protocol.

245
09:12.892 --> 09:14.039
(Store Transfer Agreement)

246
09:14.039 --> 09:14.840
(Contract's fine.)

247
09:15.200 --> 09:15.919
(You can sign it.)

248
09:16.252 --> 09:16.712
(Store Transfer Agreement)

249
09:16.796 --> 09:18.600
(Zi)

250
09:22.399 --> 09:23.519
Meng!

251
09:24.200 --> 09:24.759
Hurry.

252
09:24.799 --> 09:25.480
Tell me.

253
09:25.720 --> 09:27.080
Did Di Liren's nose crook with rage

254
09:27.080 --> 09:28.240
when you returned to Jiali?

255
09:28.240 --> 09:29.080
Of course.

256
09:29.080 --> 09:30.080
Not just his nose.

257
09:30.080 --> 09:31.320
He was crooked through.

258
09:31.559 --> 09:32.879
He's utterly corrupt.

259
09:34.200 --> 09:35.440
Where is everyone?

260
09:35.879 --> 09:37.000
Not even a single server?

261
09:38.080 --> 09:39.360
Because

262
09:39.440 --> 09:40.960
the manager laid them all off.

263
09:41.039 --> 09:42.267
Then where's the manager?

264
09:43.320 --> 09:43.960
Right here.

265
09:44.279 --> 09:44.960
Where?

266
09:44.960 --> 09:45.679
Right here.

267
09:45.759 --> 09:46.519
Where?

268
09:47.600 --> 09:48.759
(Rooftop Cafe Transfer Agreement) Surprise!

269
09:49.279 --> 09:49.960
Take a look.

270
09:50.240 --> 09:51.080
What's this?

271
09:51.600 --> 09:52.960
It's a surprise for you.

272
09:53.159 --> 09:55.000
The moment you said you wanted a shop,

273
09:55.039 --> 09:56.120
I thought of this place.

274
09:56.320 --> 09:57.440
Where did you get the money?

275
09:57.679 --> 09:59.440
Isn't this Harry's friend's cafe?

276
09:59.559 --> 10:00.919
Actually,

277
10:01.080 --> 10:02.440
business was never great here,

278
10:02.519 --> 10:03.519
and Harry said his friend

279
10:03.519 --> 10:04.519
could barely stay afloat.

280
10:05.039 --> 10:06.360
I saw him looking to sublease

281
10:06.360 --> 10:07.120
a while ago,

282
10:07.120 --> 10:08.320
so I took it over.

283
10:08.720 --> 10:10.879
As for the money,

284
10:10.960 --> 10:12.639
don't I work at Jiali?

285
10:12.919 --> 10:13.720
And livestream sales

286
10:13.720 --> 10:14.320
pay well.

287
10:14.360 --> 10:15.759
So don't worry about the money.

288
10:16.080 --> 10:17.159
Right now,

289
10:17.200 --> 10:18.399
you need that money

290
10:18.440 --> 10:19.679
for your living expenses.

291
10:20.759 --> 10:21.759
Come on,

292
10:21.879 --> 10:22.840
don't be so practical,

293
10:22.879 --> 10:23.480
will you?

294
10:23.639 --> 10:25.279
Money can always be earned back.

295
10:27.080 --> 10:28.440
All these years in the workplace,

296
10:28.600 --> 10:29.399
you've been like

297
10:29.519 --> 10:30.600
a perpetual motion machine.

298
10:30.720 --> 10:31.279
You did

299
10:31.279 --> 10:32.320
a whole team's work alone.

300
10:32.320 --> 10:33.559
You worked every day

301
10:33.559 --> 10:34.440
of the year.

302
10:34.519 --> 10:35.919
Even on maternity leave,

303
10:36.000 --> 10:37.039
you were on that laptop,

304
10:37.080 --> 10:38.240
working non-stop.

305
10:38.320 --> 10:39.114
Weren't you tired?

306
10:41.600 --> 10:43.279
So when I heard you say

307
10:43.639 --> 10:44.960
you wanted to take a break,

308
10:45.399 --> 10:46.440
I was really happy.

309
10:46.960 --> 10:49.039
Taking a break doesn't mean slacking off.

310
10:49.120 --> 10:50.480
Of course you can't slack off.

311
10:51.519 --> 10:52.399
This shop will need

312
10:52.399 --> 10:54.000
your management to make money.

313
10:54.039 --> 10:54.919
Make me money, okay?

314
10:54.919 --> 10:55.720
No slacking off.

315
10:56.840 --> 10:57.279
Come on.

316
10:57.879 --> 10:58.639
Listen to me.

317
10:59.039 --> 11:00.080
The shares of this cafe

318
11:00.200 --> 11:01.320
are fifty-fifty between us.

319
11:01.559 --> 11:02.120
It's settled.

320
11:03.480 --> 11:04.120
Listen.

321
11:04.159 --> 11:05.200
The sofas

322
11:05.279 --> 11:05.720
won't do.

323
11:05.799 --> 11:06.840
Neither color works.

324
11:06.879 --> 11:07.510
Not your style.

325
11:08.360 --> 11:09.080
And over here,

326
11:09.080 --> 11:10.000
the lighting is great.

327
11:10.159 --> 11:11.080
You can put some

328
11:11.120 --> 11:12.360
greenery that you like.

329
11:13.039 --> 11:13.559
Right.

330
11:13.960 --> 11:14.559
And over there.

331
11:14.960 --> 11:15.911
Guess what goes there?

332
11:18.000 --> 11:19.240
A record player?

333
11:19.360 --> 11:21.120
Yes. You're so sharp.

334
11:22.600 --> 11:23.639
Your record player

335
11:23.679 --> 11:24.440
can go right here,

336
11:24.799 --> 11:25.679
playing your

337
11:25.679 --> 11:26.720
favorite songs every day.

338
11:27.120 --> 11:28.799
It's just perfect.

339
11:28.960 --> 11:30.320
Still, professional matters

340
11:30.320 --> 11:31.840
should be left to professionals.

341
11:32.159 --> 11:33.159
Didn't Harry create

342
11:33.159 --> 11:34.200
a full design proposal

343
11:34.240 --> 11:35.320
for this place earlier?

344
11:35.879 --> 11:36.480
Right.

345
11:36.679 --> 11:37.600
I saw that proposal.

346
11:37.639 --> 11:38.519
It was really good.

347
11:38.919 --> 11:40.480
- Why not talk to him? - Talk to him.

348
11:41.759 --> 11:42.519
We're in sync.

349
11:42.519 --> 11:43.279
Let's talk to him.

350
11:43.279 --> 11:44.200
(General Manager Yu Meng)

351
11:44.200 --> 11:44.720
Ms. Yu,

352
11:44.879 --> 11:45.759
this is the agreement

353
11:45.799 --> 11:46.759
to terminate

354
11:46.759 --> 11:47.759
Jinghua's partnership

355
11:47.799 --> 11:48.600
with Guangsili'er.

356
11:49.039 --> 11:49.519
This one

357
11:49.519 --> 11:51.080
is the complaint against them

358
11:51.159 --> 11:52.559
for breach of contract.

359
11:52.799 --> 11:53.480
And the last one

360
11:53.840 --> 11:55.039
is the OEM contract

361
11:55.120 --> 11:56.519
with Jinghua's new factory.

362
11:56.600 --> 11:57.360
Please sign them.

363
12:04.091 --> 12:07.336
(Signature: Yu Meng)

364
12:14.000 --> 12:14.639
Stop it.

365
12:16.639 --> 12:17.240
You don't mean

366
12:17.240 --> 12:18.240
the sheets, do you?

367
12:19.000 --> 12:20.200
Stop your fight with Yu Meng.

368
12:20.720 --> 12:21.320
Just stop it.

369
12:22.399 --> 12:23.440
You must be kidding me.

370
12:23.919 --> 12:25.080
We're at the goal line,

371
12:25.879 --> 12:26.908
and you want me to quit?

372
12:27.039 --> 12:28.639
Face reality.

373
12:29.720 --> 12:30.919
Yu Meng is the one kicking.

374
12:31.480 --> 12:32.399
And you're the ball.

375
12:32.600 --> 12:33.519
If you keep fighting,

376
12:33.679 --> 12:34.480
you'll lose more.

377
12:36.480 --> 12:37.720
It's just a minor bump,

378
12:37.840 --> 12:39.120
and you're already backing down?

379
12:39.840 --> 12:40.840
The problem is Haoyu.

380
12:41.559 --> 12:42.720
He's already suspecting

381
12:42.720 --> 12:43.600
that I know Yu Meng.

382
12:44.519 --> 12:45.919
To keep him from digging further,

383
12:46.919 --> 12:48.039
I'm resigning next week

384
12:48.879 --> 12:49.679
and taking him away.

385
12:50.879 --> 12:51.600
Are you coming?

386
12:52.200 --> 12:52.879
You think Yu Meng

387
12:52.879 --> 12:54.320
will let you leave that easily?

388
12:55.279 --> 12:56.559
She's already targeting Haoyu.

389
12:57.279 --> 12:58.559
If she sees that you're scared,

390
12:59.159 --> 13:00.600
she'll tear you apart even more.

391
13:01.080 --> 13:02.440
So we can only push forward.

392
13:02.840 --> 13:03.399
No retreat.

393
13:04.200 --> 13:05.399
Framing Yu Meng

394
13:06.039 --> 13:07.279
as mentally unstable

395
13:07.360 --> 13:08.399
was crazy enough.

396
13:09.120 --> 13:10.039
If you take it further,

397
13:10.799 --> 13:11.759
will it be a crime?

398
13:13.960 --> 13:14.840
Of course not.

399
13:16.000 --> 13:16.519
We aren't

400
13:16.559 --> 13:17.480
cornered yet.

401
13:18.120 --> 13:19.559
But Jinghua belongs to Yu Meng now.

402
13:20.600 --> 13:21.279
She's already

403
13:21.279 --> 13:22.279
found a new factory.

404
13:23.120 --> 13:24.320
Do you think I'll just let her

405
13:24.399 --> 13:25.360
walk away with it?

406
13:27.320 --> 13:28.759
(CFO Dong Jun) We don't have the funds.

407
13:28.840 --> 13:30.159
We can't cover the deposit.

408
13:30.639 --> 13:31.559
No funds?

409
13:32.559 --> 13:33.440
How could that be?

410
13:34.120 --> 13:35.519
For a physical business like ours,

411
13:35.600 --> 13:37.279
cash flow is always tight.

412
13:37.399 --> 13:38.879
We rely heavily on receivables

413
13:38.879 --> 13:40.840
from various sales channels.

414
13:41.039 --> 13:42.000
The one holding Jiali's

415
13:42.000 --> 13:43.120
biggest distribution channel

416
13:43.120 --> 13:43.720
is Ms. Xu.

417
13:44.320 --> 13:44.960
The payment

418
13:45.000 --> 13:46.120
was due to hit our account

419
13:46.120 --> 13:46.960
this week.

420
13:47.200 --> 13:49.000
I've pressed her repeatedly,

421
13:49.360 --> 13:50.600
but she's either on a trip

422
13:50.639 --> 13:51.679
or in a meeting.

423
13:51.799 --> 13:52.759
She just won't pay.

424
13:54.399 --> 13:56.039
Something fishy is definitely going on.

425
13:56.879 --> 13:57.879
I'll go collect it.

426
13:59.480 --> 14:00.399
That smash

427
14:00.399 --> 14:01.639
was amazing, Ms. Xu.

428
14:06.159 --> 14:07.039
Mr. Di, your wife

429
14:07.120 --> 14:08.320
sure is something.

430
14:09.000 --> 14:11.000
She went straight to my company.

431
14:12.559 --> 14:13.600
I'm sorry about that.

432
14:14.440 --> 14:15.840
She's just stubborn.

433
14:16.000 --> 14:16.679
Just ignore her.

434
14:17.480 --> 14:18.919
Sorry, you'll have to stay here,

435
14:19.360 --> 14:20.360
playing tennis

436
14:20.399 --> 14:20.919
and relaxing.

437
14:21.240 --> 14:22.200
I couldn't be happier.

438
14:22.879 --> 14:24.200
After busting my neck all year,

439
14:24.519 --> 14:26.000
I finally get to relax

440
14:26.120 --> 14:26.840
and breathe.

441
14:27.559 --> 14:28.639
Though I must warn you,

442
14:29.279 --> 14:30.879
don't push your wife too far.

443
14:31.320 --> 14:31.960
In case

444
14:32.279 --> 14:33.279
she sues me.

445
14:33.639 --> 14:34.519
She's in a rush

446
14:34.720 --> 14:35.879
to get cash right now.

447
14:36.399 --> 14:38.080
Lawsuits take forever.

448
14:38.440 --> 14:39.639
She won't take that route.

449
14:39.799 --> 14:41.080
If she actually sues me,

450
14:41.360 --> 14:42.240
I'll go to you.

451
14:43.200 --> 14:44.159
Don't try to run.

452
14:44.519 --> 14:45.159
See you.

453
15:04.879 --> 15:05.799
Why are you here?

454
15:07.200 --> 15:08.492
Didn't get the money, right?

455
15:08.679 --> 15:09.639
I looked into it.

456
15:11.240 --> 15:11.840
You

457
15:12.240 --> 15:13.320
checked into Ms. Xu?

458
15:13.919 --> 15:14.759
I have to serve

459
15:14.759 --> 15:16.039
my client anytime, anywhere.

460
15:16.480 --> 15:17.840
I can't have you divorced,

461
15:17.879 --> 15:19.000
broke, and out of a company.

462
15:26.720 --> 15:27.440
You know what?

463
15:27.559 --> 15:28.639
I suddenly feel like

464
15:28.960 --> 15:30.240
every penny I paid you

465
15:30.360 --> 15:31.120
wasn't wasted.

466
15:31.480 --> 15:32.200
Totally worth it.

467
15:32.799 --> 15:34.399
Why does that sound so...

468
15:34.399 --> 15:35.559
All right, jokes aside.

469
15:36.159 --> 15:36.919
Down to business.

470
15:37.279 --> 15:38.559
Are you going to say

471
15:38.879 --> 15:40.799
Ms. Xu is close with Di Liren,

472
15:40.879 --> 15:42.000
so even if I confront her,

473
15:42.720 --> 15:43.759
nothing will come of it?

474
15:44.240 --> 15:45.440
Impressive.

475
15:46.360 --> 15:47.360
There's another angle.

476
15:47.879 --> 15:49.080
I suspect Jiali's funds

477
15:49.159 --> 15:50.000
were moved abroad.

478
15:50.519 --> 15:51.240
If we track down

479
15:51.240 --> 15:52.320
Han Guang's accounts abroad,

480
15:52.320 --> 15:53.399
we'll have proof of him

481
15:53.440 --> 15:54.639
embezzling company assets.

482
15:55.200 --> 15:56.159
Given the huge amount,

483
15:56.200 --> 15:57.120
he'd be facing

484
15:57.200 --> 15:58.000
serious prison time.

485
15:58.200 --> 15:59.360
We can use it to force him

486
15:59.440 --> 16:00.559
to return the money.

487
16:00.759 --> 16:01.279
That way,

488
16:01.519 --> 16:02.159
the company's

489
16:02.159 --> 16:03.200
money issue can be solved.

490
16:05.519 --> 16:06.639
The logic works,

491
16:07.039 --> 16:08.039
but to find

492
16:08.120 --> 16:09.799
Han Guang's accounts aboard...

493
16:10.080 --> 16:11.120
You overlooked someone.

494
16:11.519 --> 16:12.000
Who?

495
16:12.360 --> 16:12.919
Lu Hui.

496
16:15.240 --> 16:16.039
She can be the key.

497
16:16.799 --> 16:17.559
So,

498
16:18.240 --> 16:19.519
I actually think

499
16:19.879 --> 16:21.120
there's someone we can use.

500
16:23.639 --> 16:24.960
Speak of the devil.

501
16:25.759 --> 16:26.279
Meng.

502
16:26.440 --> 16:26.960
Xu.

503
16:29.480 --> 16:30.080
Well,

504
16:30.600 --> 16:31.919
can I talk to you in private?

505
16:33.480 --> 16:34.039
Sure.

506
16:37.320 --> 16:37.879
I'm off then.

507
16:38.360 --> 16:39.279
Did you come to me

508
16:39.559 --> 16:40.679
because that friend of yours

509
16:41.080 --> 16:41.960
has another problem?

510
16:45.240 --> 16:46.120
He found out

511
16:47.360 --> 16:47.960
his mom

512
16:48.039 --> 16:49.399
lied to him about her job.

513
16:50.559 --> 16:51.600
And he realized

514
16:52.879 --> 16:53.799
his mom might know

515
16:53.879 --> 16:55.080
his dad's current wife.

516
16:55.480 --> 16:56.600
But she keeps denying it.

517
16:57.679 --> 16:58.679
He wants to know why.

518
16:58.799 --> 16:59.360
So

519
17:00.080 --> 17:01.720
he wants to ask his dad's current wife

520
17:03.279 --> 17:05.480
because he thinks she's a good person.

521
17:13.000 --> 17:14.400
At your friend's age,

522
17:15.200 --> 17:16.640
he should focus on his studies.

523
17:17.240 --> 17:18.240
Let his parents

524
17:19.119 --> 17:20.279
sort out their own matters.

525
17:21.240 --> 17:21.759
Actually...

526
17:23.599 --> 17:25.119
Actually that friend was me all along.

527
17:27.079 --> 17:27.880
And

528
17:28.640 --> 17:29.519
you're part

529
17:30.519 --> 17:31.400
of that story too.

530
17:40.440 --> 17:41.400
He is my dad,

531
17:41.920 --> 17:43.039
your current husband.

532
17:43.880 --> 17:44.799
And she is my mom,

533
17:45.240 --> 17:46.359
your husband's ex-wife.

534
17:46.920 --> 17:47.799
Did you know?

535
17:48.200 --> 17:48.759
I know.

536
17:49.799 --> 17:50.440
You know?

537
17:51.960 --> 17:52.920
So you know my mom?

538
17:54.839 --> 17:55.519
No.

539
17:56.093 --> 17:56.920
Then how do you know

540
17:56.920 --> 17:58.017
my dad was married before?

541
17:58.359 --> 17:59.200
Did he tell you?

542
18:03.440 --> 18:04.519
I never asked much

543
18:04.559 --> 18:05.640
about your dad's life

544
18:06.640 --> 18:07.480
as Fang Yong.

545
18:08.119 --> 18:09.119
After all, this life

546
18:09.359 --> 18:10.680
is ours to live.

547
18:10.960 --> 18:11.720
Asking too much

548
18:12.240 --> 18:13.240
only brings heartache.

549
18:15.680 --> 18:16.240
I'm sorry.

550
18:16.359 --> 18:16.759
I...

551
18:18.119 --> 18:19.160
I shouldn't have said it.

552
18:19.200 --> 18:19.640
I...

553
18:20.240 --> 18:21.039
I'm only...

554
18:21.279 --> 18:22.079
It's all right.

555
18:22.839 --> 18:23.646
You're still Harry.

556
18:24.480 --> 18:25.400
Nothing has changed.

557
18:26.279 --> 18:26.799
Then

558
18:27.279 --> 18:28.839
can I still call you Meng?

559
18:29.079 --> 18:29.680
Of course.

560
18:30.359 --> 18:30.759
Then

561
18:31.079 --> 18:32.359
we're still friends, right?

562
18:33.640 --> 18:34.839
Aren't we friends right now?

563
18:36.240 --> 18:37.599
Actually, none of this

564
18:38.000 --> 18:39.039
is that hard to accept

565
18:39.279 --> 18:40.119
or understand.

566
18:40.680 --> 18:42.240
Just focus on being yourself.

567
18:44.720 --> 18:45.599
Still,

568
18:46.920 --> 18:48.759
let's keep your "friend's" family matters

569
18:49.240 --> 18:50.440
as a secret

570
18:50.680 --> 18:51.440
between

571
18:51.440 --> 18:52.440
the two of us.

572
18:53.400 --> 18:53.799
Okay.

573
18:55.759 --> 18:56.680
When vacation ends,

574
18:56.680 --> 18:57.880
head back to school.

575
18:58.960 --> 19:00.160
Let's wrap up your time

576
19:00.799 --> 19:01.680
as my assistant.

577
19:02.039 --> 19:03.160
Why? But

578
19:03.440 --> 19:04.319
didn't we just agree

579
19:04.359 --> 19:05.445
we could still be friends?

580
19:05.799 --> 19:06.359
No need to be

581
19:06.359 --> 19:07.400
my assistant for that.

582
19:08.079 --> 19:09.759
Besides, you're the designer

583
19:09.880 --> 19:10.839
Liu Zi and I

584
19:10.839 --> 19:11.759
hired exclusively.

585
19:12.920 --> 19:13.400
Okay.

586
19:18.160 --> 19:19.039
Not busy with work?

587
19:19.178 --> 19:20.000
How'd you get time

588
19:20.000 --> 19:21.079
to come fishing with me?

589
19:21.559 --> 19:22.319
I was let go.

590
19:30.720 --> 19:31.880
Isn't that great?

591
19:32.480 --> 19:34.319
Now you can do what you actually love.

592
19:41.559 --> 19:43.799
This is a top architecture firm's

593
19:44.039 --> 19:45.039
internship offer.

594
19:45.559 --> 19:46.559
You can start right away.

595
19:50.880 --> 19:52.240
I thought you'd be thrilled.

596
19:52.440 --> 19:54.079
You were against me studying architecture.

597
19:55.839 --> 19:57.559
That's why I prepared a backup for you.

598
20:00.759 --> 20:01.519
This is

599
20:02.599 --> 20:04.720
a recommendation letter from a renowned

600
20:05.200 --> 20:06.400
architecture professor.

601
20:09.039 --> 20:10.240
When you graduate college

602
20:10.279 --> 20:11.480
and face the real world,

603
20:12.839 --> 20:13.799
you can use it

604
20:14.119 --> 20:15.240
to apply for grad school

605
20:15.319 --> 20:16.079
and study further.

606
20:16.519 --> 20:17.759
I'm not that fragile.

607
20:18.480 --> 20:19.680
Then do the internship first?

608
20:20.160 --> 20:21.000
I'll set it up.

609
20:22.359 --> 20:22.759
Don't.

610
20:25.079 --> 20:26.480
How about next break?

611
20:27.200 --> 20:27.799
Why?

612
20:29.240 --> 20:30.279
Isn't this your dream?

613
20:31.319 --> 20:31.960
Besides,

614
20:32.160 --> 20:33.400
you still have a month off.

615
20:36.759 --> 20:37.200
Dad,

616
20:38.400 --> 20:39.640
you told me on the phone

617
20:40.319 --> 20:41.319
that whatever happens,

618
20:41.319 --> 20:43.200
you and Mom would explain it to me in person.

619
20:44.200 --> 20:44.839
Was that true?

620
20:46.920 --> 20:47.640
Of course.

621
20:48.200 --> 20:49.319
Are you sure you haven't

622
20:49.319 --> 20:50.119
done anything

623
20:51.079 --> 20:52.279
to hurt Mom or Meng?

624
20:55.960 --> 20:57.200
Are you worried

625
20:57.200 --> 20:58.920
I'm getting back with your mom

626
20:59.400 --> 21:00.400
while lying to Yu Meng,

627
21:01.079 --> 21:02.079
playing both sides?

628
21:05.960 --> 21:06.799
Do you really think

629
21:06.799 --> 21:07.960
I'm that despicable?

630
21:16.160 --> 21:16.880
I'm sorry.

631
21:17.680 --> 21:18.559
My head has been

632
21:19.599 --> 21:20.480
such a mess lately.

633
21:23.759 --> 21:24.400
Haoyu,

634
21:26.279 --> 21:27.759
I only have one request for you:

635
21:28.799 --> 21:30.559
take good care of your health.

636
21:31.400 --> 21:32.839
Don't worry about anything else.

637
21:35.440 --> 21:36.039
Got it.

638
21:42.240 --> 21:43.440
The fish soup is simmering.

639
21:43.759 --> 21:45.000
I'll make a full fish feast

640
21:45.400 --> 21:46.200
with the rest.

641
21:50.559 --> 21:51.079
Honey,

642
21:52.480 --> 21:53.559
my car got covered in mud

643
21:53.640 --> 21:54.680
while out fishing today.

644
21:54.759 --> 21:55.480
It's being washed.

645
21:56.071 --> 21:56.839
When your assistant

646
21:56.839 --> 21:57.799
picks you up tomorrow,

647
21:57.880 --> 21:58.849
can I get a ride too?

648
22:02.240 --> 22:03.000
He resigned.

649
22:06.200 --> 22:07.359
Kids these days

650
22:07.599 --> 22:08.599
sure are spontaneous.

651
22:34.440 --> 22:35.519
We meet again, Mr. Di.

652
22:38.359 --> 22:39.359
Jiao Xu?

653
22:40.279 --> 22:40.680
You...

654
22:43.200 --> 22:44.559
Has Liu Zi arrived yet?

655
22:44.839 --> 22:45.680
We agreed to eat

656
22:45.759 --> 22:46.440
here tonight

657
22:46.440 --> 22:47.480
for Harry's send-off.

658
22:47.680 --> 22:48.880
She better not be late.

659
22:50.519 --> 22:51.079
Honey,

660
22:51.559 --> 22:52.559
why didn't you tell me

661
22:52.680 --> 22:53.880
you invited guests for dinner?

662
22:54.559 --> 22:56.079
We're unprepared. It's so rude.

663
22:56.400 --> 22:56.920
How about

664
22:57.200 --> 22:58.160
I take everyone out?

665
22:58.240 --> 22:59.359
Don't bother, Mr. Di.

666
22:59.559 --> 23:00.279
We brought food.

667
23:00.720 --> 23:01.440
It's about fun.

668
23:04.200 --> 23:05.039
By that smell,

669
23:05.440 --> 23:06.359
is that fish soup?

670
23:41.440 --> 23:43.079
W-What is all this?

671
23:45.279 --> 23:46.480
You must be Ms. Hui.

672
23:47.200 --> 23:48.599
Yu Meng speaks so highly of you,

673
23:48.599 --> 23:49.559
saying your housework

674
23:49.559 --> 23:50.359
is the best.

675
23:50.440 --> 23:51.119
She said you're

676
23:51.119 --> 23:52.559
her favorite housekeeper so far.

677
23:54.279 --> 23:55.119
Housekeeper?

678
23:55.960 --> 23:56.920
Watch your manners.

679
23:57.359 --> 23:58.799
You should call her Aunt Hui.

680
24:00.720 --> 24:01.519
This is Harry,

681
24:01.839 --> 24:02.839
Yu Meng's assistant.

682
24:06.519 --> 24:07.920
Look, it still needs cleaning up.

683
24:08.559 --> 24:09.400
Let's eat out.

684
24:10.039 --> 24:10.658
I'll help you.

685
24:12.599 --> 24:13.079
No need.

686
24:14.200 --> 24:14.799
Mr. Di,

687
24:15.200 --> 24:16.200
I've been in for a while.

688
24:16.400 --> 24:17.240
No tea for me?

689
24:20.839 --> 24:21.279
Please.

690
24:35.359 --> 24:36.759
Why didn't you tell me?

691
24:41.960 --> 24:42.799
What's going on?

692
24:44.759 --> 24:45.880
Why are you a housekeeper?

693
24:46.240 --> 24:47.079
Why at Meng's place?

694
24:47.240 --> 24:48.440
You said you didn't know her.

695
24:50.680 --> 24:51.200
Mom!

696
24:51.759 --> 24:52.759
Keep your voice down.

697
24:54.200 --> 24:55.200
Let me finish cooking.

698
24:55.240 --> 24:56.119
Then I'll tell you.

699
24:56.160 --> 24:56.599
All right?

700
25:00.200 --> 25:00.759
