1047
38:05.840 --> 38:06.920
(Meet and talk tomorrow?)

1048
38:39.599 --> 38:40.239
Meng,

1049
38:40.400 --> 38:41.320
are you at the office?

1050
38:41.719 --> 38:43.079
I brought you some breakfast.

1051
38:44.320 --> 38:44.960
Haoyu?

1052
38:48.840 --> 38:49.320
Didn't you

1053
38:49.320 --> 38:50.280
eat breakfast at home?

1054
38:50.840 --> 38:52.079
Why did you buy so much bread?

1055
38:53.000 --> 38:54.400
I got it for my coworkers.

1056
38:56.280 --> 38:57.719
Are you still shooting with Yu Meng?

1057
38:58.000 --> 38:58.559
I don't know

1058
38:58.559 --> 38:59.360
if she'll take me.

1059
39:00.039 --> 39:00.559
Why do you

1060
39:00.559 --> 39:01.480
care so much for her?

1061
39:02.280 --> 39:02.719
Mom,

1062
39:02.840 --> 39:04.079
Meng treats me really well.

1063
39:06.519 --> 39:07.519
Did you know all along

1064
39:07.760 --> 39:08.480
who Yu Meng was?

1065
39:11.800 --> 39:12.800
Is she truly kind to you?

1066
39:13.480 --> 39:14.599
She stood up for me

1067
39:14.639 --> 39:15.719
and treated me to great food.

1068
39:15.719 --> 39:16.239
And

1069
39:16.599 --> 39:17.599
she mentors me at work.

1070
39:18.320 --> 39:19.239
Alright, I have to go.

1071
39:19.480 --> 39:20.400
Where are you going?

1072
39:21.800 --> 39:22.400
The vendor

1073
39:22.480 --> 39:23.239
overcharged me.

1074
39:24.320 --> 39:25.230
I'll fix it with her.

1075
39:47.960 --> 39:48.559
Hello there,

1076
39:49.039 --> 39:49.760
Harry's mom.

1077
40:02.235 --> 40:04.808
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1078
40:05.519 --> 40:06.880
Where are you going?

1079
40:07.000 --> 40:07.880
I'm taking you abroad.

1080
40:08.079 --> 40:09.070
The flight is tomorrow.

1081
40:09.199 --> 40:09.679
- Don't - Haoyu!

1082
40:09.679 --> 40:10.639
treat me like a child.

1083
40:11.000 --> 40:11.920
- You keep everything - Haoyu!

1084
40:11.920 --> 40:12.760
from me,

1085
40:13.199 --> 40:13.719
yet expect me

1086
40:13.719 --> 40:14.639
to obey your decisions.

1087
40:14.960 --> 40:15.840
I'm not going abroad,

1088
40:15.920 --> 40:17.360
and I'm not coming back anymore!

1089
40:18.719 --> 40:19.480
Stop calling.

1090
40:20.960 --> 40:21.679
He won't pick up.

1091
40:23.440 --> 40:25.079
The company is facing a cash crunch

1092
40:25.440 --> 40:26.599
created by Di Liren.

1093
40:28.239 --> 40:29.679
Help me resolve that first,

1094
40:30.320 --> 40:31.000
and I'll help you

1095
40:31.000 --> 40:31.679
with Harry.

1096
40:32.679 --> 40:33.800
It's about Ms. Xu, isn't it?

1097
40:35.280 --> 40:35.960
Hello, Ms. Xu.

1098
40:51.272 --> 40:56.141
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1099
40:58.625 --> 41:03.488
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1100
41:05.946 --> 41:10.791
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1101
41:11.236 --> 41:17.738
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1102
41:20.470 --> 41:27.423
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1103
41:27.973 --> 41:33.903
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

1104
41:35.027 --> 41:42.258
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1105
41:42.561 --> 41:47.734
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

1106
41:48.354 --> 41:59.822
♪In this life, I follow only my own choice♪

1107
42:02.322 --> 42:07.570
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1108
42:09.611 --> 42:15.046
♪No need to echo those who drifted apart♪

1109
42:16.868 --> 42:22.265
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1110
42:22.265 --> 42:30.910
♪The answer has long been etched in my silhouette♪

1111
42:31.386 --> 42:38.949
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1112
42:38.949 --> 42:44.795
♪Paving every twist and turn into a path forward♪

1113
42:44.795 --> 42:54.962
♪The ending of this life will be set by me♪
